ry', 'Irontread Crusher', "Kari Zev's Expertise", 'Kari Zev, Skyship Raider', 'Lathnu Sailback', 'Leave in the Dust', 'Lifecraft Awakening', 'Lifecraft Cavalry', "Lifecrafter's Bestiary", "Lifecrafter's Gift", 'Lightning Runner', 'Maulfist Revolutionary', 'Maverick Thopterist', 'Mechanized Production', "Merchant's Dockhand", 'Metallic Mimic', 'Metallic Rebuke', 'Midnight Entourage', 'Mobile Garrison', 'Monstrous Onslaught', 'Narnam Renegade', 'Natural Obsolescence', 'Negate', 'Night Market Aeronaut', 'Night Market Guard', 'Oath of Ajani', 'Ornithopter', 'Outland Boar', 'Pacification Array', 'Paradox Engine', 'Peacewalker Colossus', 'Peema Aether-Seer', 'Pendulum of Patterns', 'Perilous Predicament', "Pia's Revolution", 'Planar Bridge', 'Precise Strike', 'Prey Upon', 'Prizefighter Construct', 'Quicksmith Rebel', 'Quicksmith Spy', 'Ravenous Intruder', 'Reckless Racer', 'Release the Gremlins', 'Renegade Map', 'Renegade Rallier', 'Renegade Wheelsmith', "Renegade's Getaway", 'Reservoir Walker', 'Resourceful Return', 'Restoration Specialist', 'Reverse Engineer', 'Ridgescale Tusker', "Rishkar's Expertise", 'Rishkar, Peema Renegade', 'Rogue Refiner', 'Salvage Scuttler', 'Scrap Trawler', 'Scrapper Champion', 'Scrounging Bandar', 'Secret Salvage', 'Servo Schematic', 'Shielded Aether Thief', 'Shipwreck Moray', 'Shock', 'Siege Modification', 'Silkweaver Elite', 'Skyship Plunderer', 'Sly Requisitioner', 'Solemn Recruit', 'Spire Patrol', 'Spire of Industry', "Sram's Expertise", 'Sram, Senior Edificer', 'Submerged Boneyard', 'Sweatworks Brawler', 'Take into Custody', 'Tezzeret the Schemer', "Tezzeret's Betrayal", "Tezzeret's Simulacrum", "Tezzeret's Touch", 'Tezzeret, Master of Metal', 'Thopter Arrest', 'Tranquil Expanse', 'Treasure Keeper', 'Trophy Mage', 'Unbridled Growth', 'Universal Solvent', 'Untethered Express', 'Vengeful Rebel', 'Verdant Automaton', 'Walking Ballista', 'Watchful Automaton', 'Welder Automaton', 'Weldfast Engineer', 'Whir of Invention', 'Wind-Kin Raiders', 'W